# Travel summary

The daily allowance for domestic travel is sixty (60) EUR [[cite:obs-180e9dc4e39f4436d1ac773ba13fa9e87dd69254 "The daily allowance for domestic travel is sixty (60) EUR."]]. Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director [[cite:obs-23368ba6840031cd61e7313c5d05f38607a83d1f "Trips with a total cost above one thousand (1000) EUR need written approval by a director."]].
